OL,3,GNEWSACancer help 'like popping into a
OL,4,Aneighbour's house'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity that was started a year ago
OL,7,Fto help people affected by cancer is
OL,8,F"like popping into a neighbour's
OL,9,Fhouse", a supporter has said.
OL,11,FSue Phelps' husband Steven has stage 3
OL,12,Fbowel cancer and she added that being
OL,13,Fable to get help from Maggie's, in the
OL,14,Fgrounds of Northampton General
OL,15,FHospital, felt "like I'd stepped into
OL,16,Fsomewhere with people who understand".
OL,18,FSince it opened in October 2025, the
OL,19,Fcharity said it had had more than 5,000
OL,20,Fvisits from many different people
OL,21,Faffected by the disease.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
